{"id":393,"ts":"2026-04-05T17:57:47.461Z","type":"chat_request","payload":{"requestedModel":"claude-opus-4-6","resolvedModel":"claude-opus-4-6","modelId":null,"requestedConversationId":null,"conversationId":"69d2a28b98ad45638b536150","sessionKey":"9a9ba6019c6016ce","systemPromptMode":"passthrough","requestedSystemMessage":"You are a senior information architect auditing a RAG knowledge base for Istanbul Bilgi University students and staff. Your job: evaluate document clusters from a retrieval quality perspective — will real users find exactly what they need? Be critical. Vague or over-broad clusters in high-query areas are bugs, not features. Return only valid JSON.","effectiveSystemMessage":"You are a senior information architect auditing a RAG knowledge base for Istanbul Bilgi University students and staff. Your job: evaluate document clusters from a retrieval quality perspective — will real users find exactly what they need? Be critical. Vague or over-broad clusters in high-query areas are bugs, not features. Return only valid JSON.","latestUserText":"You are auditing leaf clusters in a university RAG system.\nFor each leaf, think: \"If a student/staff member asks a natural language question, will this cluster deliver exactly the right documents?\"\n\nUniversity information hierarchy (for context):\n  regulations/   → binding rules (yönetmelik, yönerge, directives, handbooks)\n  academics/     → courses, programs, ECTS catalog, departments, graduation\n  student_life/  → career services, internship, counseling, clubs\n  admissions/    → applications, entrance exams, transfer\n  international/ → Erasmus, exchange, incoming students\n  quality/       → accreditation, self-evaluation (internal use — rarely queried)\n  people/        → staff profiles (low query volume)\n  news/events/   → announcements (low query volume)\n\nRETRIEVAL IMPORTANCE:\n  critical = queried many times daily (regulations, course catalog, scholarship rules)\n  high     = queried frequently (p